{"ID":"20240205153847-eepruzr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153847-eepruzr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153847-eepruzr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085016-0e7i7l8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616125306-ohg4zsw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619105447-1kxx088\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"055黄连","type":"doc","updated":"20240806143012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206085016-0e7i7l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085016-0e7i7l8","updated":"20240206085020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产重庆、湖北、陕西、甘肃等地。\n【性状】\t味连：药材多数聚集成簇，常常弯曲，形如鸡爪，其单枝根茎长36cm，直径0.30.8cm。表面粗糙，有不规则结节状隆起，有须根及须根残基。节间表面平滑如茎杆。其上部多残留褐色鳞叶，顶端常留有残余的茎或叶柄。表面灰黄色或黄褐色。质硬，断面不整齐，皮部橙红色或暗棕色，木部鲜黄色或橙黄色，呈放射状排列，髓部有时中空。气微，味极其苦。\n雅连：药材多为单枝、略呈圆柱形，形如“蚕状”，微弯曲，长48cm，直径0.51cm，“过桥”较长。顶端有少数残基。以身干，粗壮，无须根，形如蚕者为佳品。\n云连：药材弯曲呈钩状，形如“蝎尾”，多为单枝，较细小。以干燥、条细、节多、须根少，色黄者为佳品。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿，泻火解毒。用于湿热痞满，呕吐吞酸，泻痢，黄疸，高热神昏，心火亢盛，心烦不寐，血热吐衄，目赤，牙痛，消渴，痈肿疔疮；外治湿疹，湿疮，耳道流脓。\n【炙品】\t酒黄连：取净黄连，用酒拌匀，焖透，置锅内用文火炒干，取出，放凉。每黄连100kg，用黄酒12.5kg。引药上行，缓其寒性。善清上焦火热。用于目赤，口疮。\n姜黄连：取净黄连，加姜汁拌匀，置锅内用文火炒干，取出，放凉。每黄连100kg，用生姜12.5kg。缓和苦寒之性，增强止呕作用。善清胃和胃止呕。用于寒热互结，湿热中阻，痞满呕吐。\n吴萸连：取吴茱萸加适量水煎煮，煎液与净黄连拌匀，待液吸尽，炒干，取出，放凉。每黄连100kg，用吴茱萸10kg。 使黄连寒而不滞，清气分湿热。善舒肝和胃止呕。用于肝胃不和，呕吐吞酸。\n【注解】\t“鸡爪黄连”：味连中具有分枝，成簇，形如鸡爪者，习称“鸡爪黄连”。\n“过桥”：指黄连根茎部分细长的节间，光滑状如桥，习称“过桥”。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085009-j0fyanj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085009-j0fyanj","updated":"20240206085009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085009-dk8r9n7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155655-99eqhqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155655-99eqhqp","updated":"20240205155655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄连"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄连-20240205155655-ofr1cbv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619103841-za1bngr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619103841-za1bngr","updated":"20240619103925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄连"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄连-20240619103841-n1fhxd3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄连1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄连1-20240619103925-8x9nzd5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806131643-73zbjxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806131643-73zbjxh","updated":"20240806131705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{